{"id":"n50880-2-8","stage":2,"title":"둘레 · 周长","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n50880-2-8-1","ko":"둘레가 이백 미터인 섬이 있대.","zh":"据说有个周长达两百米的岛屿呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"둘레가","meaning":"周长","explanation":"둘레：周长；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"둘레","audio":"/audio/bca11479cbf9995f00c2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50880","senseId":"2","lemma":"둘레","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이백","meaning":"200（汉字数词）","explanation":"이백：200（汉字数词）","readings":[{"term":"이백","audio":"/audio/f3e47af08f5bcccef051.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"미터인","meaning":"米","explanation":"미터：米；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"미터","audio":"/audio/489fc50fd43c76e8813b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58160","senseId":"1","lemma":"미터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"섬이","meaning":"岛，岛屿","explanation":"섬：岛，岛屿；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"섬","audio":"/audio/ff1e417f3b3471b2fce7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65099","senseId":"1","lemma":"섬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있대.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bca11479cbf9995f","term":"둘레","zh":"周长","audio":"/audio/bca11479cbf9995f00c2.mp3","entryId":"50880","definition":"围绕事物的周边一圈的长度。","pronunciation":["둘레"]},{"id":"489fc50fd43c76e8","term":"미터","zh":"米","audio":"/audio/489fc50fd43c76e8813b.mp3","entryId":"58160","definition":"长度单位。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"ff1e417f3b3471b2","term":"섬","zh":"岛，岛屿","audio":"/audio/ff1e417f3b3471b2fce7.mp3","entryId":"65099","definition":"周围被水包围、看上去好像浮在水面上的陆地。","pronunciation":["섬ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"